A second example of the section has no config and no file of the first one.

Example input:

```yaml
on: push
jobs:
  test:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: ./.github/actions/greet
```

Output:

```
test.yaml:6:15: local action "./.github/actions/greet" is used before any checkout step in this job. the repository is not on the runner yet so the action cannot be found. add "actions/checkout" before this step or use "$/" syntax. this is reported because the "local-action-checkout" rule is enabled [local-action-checkout]
  |
6 |       - uses: ./.github/actions/greet
  |               ^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
```

